==Description==
'''v2.9.0''' is the one hundred and fifty-third update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 4th of September 2026.

This update encompassed three versions, the main v2.8.0 update (released 4 September 2026) and two minor updates, the v2.8.1 (released 4 September 2026) and v2.9.1 (released 5 September 2026.

==Additions==
===Skins===
*5 new skins for [[Beach Crate]]
**[[Crook Boss]]: {{Color|Beach|Pool Day}}
**[[Enforcer]]: {{Color|Beach|Abyssal}}
**[[Demoman]]: {{Color|Beach}}
**[[Mortar]]: {{Color|Beach}}
**[[Warlock]]: {{Color|Beach|Surfs Up}}

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*[[Sledger]] is obtainable through a gamepass for {{Robux|749}}.
*[[Warlock]] is obtainable through a gamepass for {{Robux|849}}.
*[[Commando]] is obtainable through a gamepass for {{Robux|799}}.
*[[Mercenary Base]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|1,350}} to {{Robux|945}}.
*[[Mercenary Base]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|1,800}} to {{Robux|1,260}}.
*[[Gatling Gun]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|1,949}} to {{Robux|1,364}}.
*[[Gatling Gun]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|2,599}} to {{Robux|1,819}}.
*[[Hacker]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|2,249}} to {{Robux|1,574}}.
*[[Hacker]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|2,999}} to {{Robux|2,099}}.
*[[Crook Boss]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|225}} to {{Robux|168}}.
*[[Crook Boss]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|300}} to {{Robux|225}}.
*[[Warden]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|450}} to {{Robux|337}}.
*[[Warden]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|600}} to {{Robux|450}}.
*[[Engineer]] gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|1,690}} to {{Robux|1,267}}.
*[[Engineer]] gift cost reduced from {{Robux|2,250}} to {{Robux|1,687}}.
*VIP gamepass cost reduced from {{Robux|375}} to {{Robux|300}}.
*Unused VIP gift cost reduced from {{Robux|300}} to {{Robux|240}}.
*The [[Firework Technician]], [[Farm]], [[Medic]] and [[DJ Booth]] can no longer have their targeting changed as they do not target anything.
*Updated the cosmetics icon in the inventory and the towers icon in the store.

:In '''v2.9.1''':
*Fixed [[Sledger]] gifting not working.

:In '''v2.9.1a''':
