*[[Crook Boss]] gamepass cost increased from {{Robux|168}} to {{Robux|225}}.
*[[Crook Boss]] gift cost increased from {{Robux|225}} to {{Robux|300}}.
*[[Warden]] gamepass cost increased from {{Robux|337}} to {{Robux|450}}.
*[[Warden]] gift cost increased from {{Robux|450}} to {{Robux|600}}.
*[[Engineer]] gamepass cost increased from {{Robux|1,267}} to {{Robux|1,690}}.
*[[Engineer]] gift cost increased from {{Robux|1,687}} to {{Robux|2,250}}.
*VIP gamepass cost increased from {{Robux|300}} to {{Robux|375}}.
